        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage J-CNA, Dexter Series Corona Door Knob Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Schlage Dexter Corona Knobset has a universal latch that fits either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. A simple, rounded knob, it will fit standard door cut-outs. Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. This knobset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and the 5 year finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Corona Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2, 1996, Series 4000 Grade 3.</li>\r\n<li>Exposed trim is madeout of wrought brass or bronze. Door Knobs are zinc based plated to match the finish you choose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>5-Pin tumbler standard Schlage C keyway (for Keyed Entry function) .</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n<li>5 year finish warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage Dexter Corona Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\".</li>\r\n<li>Universal latch fits either 2-3/8\"or 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim. Does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. A turn-button located in the middle of the knob locks the door while turning the inside knob unlocks it.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button. Inside locked and unlocked by turn-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Corona Door Knob, Schlage J-CNA",
                "description": "Schlage J-CNA Dexter Corona Knob - The Schlage Dexter Corona Knobset has a universal latch that fits either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. A simple, rounded knob, it will fit standard door cut-outs. Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. This knobset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and the 5 year finish warranty.",
